00:00:38.178 --> 00:00:41.338
Robert Eggers is a director known for his painstaking attention to detail.

00:00:41.344 --> 00:00:44.794
and as the final title card suggests, this film was inspired by many

00:00:44.832 --> 00:00:47.894
folktales, fairy tales, and written accounts of historical witchcraft,

00:00:47.942 --> 00:00:50.310
